WEBVTT

00:00:28.856 --> 00:00:31.773
wondering if I had any mental disorders,

00:00:31.797 --> 00:00:33.458
and it turns out I've got 12.

00:00:33.482 --> 00:00:34.633
(Laughter)

00:00:34.657 --> 00:00:37.355
I've got generalized anxiety disorder,

00:00:37.379 --> 00:00:38.625
which is a given.

00:00:38.649 --> 00:00:40.665
I've got nightmare disorder,

00:00:40.689 --> 00:00:42.054
which is categorized

00:00:42.078 --> 00:00:46.118
if you have recurrent dreams of being
pursued or declared a failure,

00:00:46.142 --> 00:00:49.817
and all my dreams involve people
chasing me down the street

00:00:49.841 --> 00:00:51.465
going, "You're a failure!"

00:00:51.489 --> 00:00:53.272
(Laughter)

00:00:53.296 --> 00:00:56.398
I've got parent-child relational problems,

00:00:56.422 --> 00:00:58.367
which I blame my parents for.

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:00.286
(Laughter)